                    "tc_name": "TCToggleTemperatureUnittoFWhenAlreadySettoF",
                    "tc_description": "Test Case Title: Toggle Temperature Unit to °F When Already Set to °F\nModule: App Settings, Temperature and Display Configuration\nPriority: Low\n\nPreconditions:\n- - The app is launched and the user is on the main screen.\n- - The temperature unit is already set to °F in settings.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Open the navigation drawer.\n2. Tap on Settings.\n3. Wait until General Settings is visible, then tap it.\n4. Wait until the Temperature option is visible, then tap it.\n5. Tap on °F (although °F is already selected).\n\nExpected Result:\n- - The temperature unit remains set to °F.\n- - No visible change or reload occurs, and the option appears selected.\n- - The app does not crash or show any error message.\n- - The main view reflects °F as the temperature unit without any disruption. (Generated from Manual Test Case)",
