                    "tc_name": "Launch App and Complete Initial Setup Successfully",
                    "thread_id": "",
                    "tc_description": "Test Case Title: Launch App and Complete Initial Setup Successfully\nModule: Launch & Initial Setup\nPriority: High\n\nPreconditions:\n- - The app is installed on the Android device.\n- - The device is turned on and connected to the internet.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Launch the app from the device home screen or app drawer.\n2. Wait for the app to finish loading.\n3. Tap OK when the initial welcome or setup dialog appears.\n4. Tap the Allow button to grant any required permissions.\n\nExpected Result:\n- - The app launches without crashing.\n- - The initial setup dialog is displayed on the first launch.\n- - The user is prompted for permissions, and on tapping Allow, the app transitions to the main screen or dashboard successfully.",
