                    "thread_id": "",
                    "tc_description": "Test Case Title: Attempt to Search for a Location Without Entering Any Text\nModule: Search for Location\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- - The app is launched and the user is on the main screen.\n- - All required permissions have been granted.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Tap the Search icon on the main screen.\n2. Wait for the Search location field to appear.\n3. Attempt to tap on the Search location field and leave it empty.\n4. Observe the results list or attempt to continue without entering any search term.\n\nExpected Result:\n- - The app should not display any results and should remain in the search input state.\n- - If the search is attempted with an empty field, an appropriate validation message or no-action response is shown.\n- - The app does not crash or proceed to a location result screen.",
